@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    ActorBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #555555
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontName "Arial"
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorFontName "Arial"
}

participant "AuctionSessionScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "AuctionSettlementService" as Settle
participant "AuctionRedisService" as Redis
participant "WalletService" as Wallet
participant "AuctionOrderSourceAdapter" as Adapter
participant "OrderService" as Order
database "MySQL DB" as DB

Scheduler -> Scheduler: Quét định kỳ (mỗi 5 giây)
activate Scheduler
note over Scheduler: Tìm các phiên ACTIVE\ncó endTime <= Now
deactivate Scheduler

Scheduler -> Settle: closeSession(sessionId) [REQUIRES_NEW Transaction]
activate Settle

Settle -> Redis: getSessionState(sessionId)
activate Redis
Redis --> Settle: RedisState (WinnerId, FinalPrice)
deactivate Redis

Settle -> DB: Cập nhật trạng thái phiên (ENDED_SUCCESS)
activate DB
DB --> Settle: Success
deactivate DB

Settle -> Wallet: Quyết toán cọc (winnerId, loserIds, sessionId)
activate Wallet
note over Wallet: 1. Khấu trừ cọc người thắng (DEDUCTED)\n2. Hoàn cọc cho tất cả người thua (REFUNDED)\n(Bảo vệ chống trùng lặp bằng operation_key)
Wallet --> Settle: Success
deactivate Wallet

Settle -> Adapter: triggerOrderCreation(sessionId, winnerId, finalPrice)
activate Adapter

Adapter -> Order: createOrder(orderRequest)
activate Order
note over Order: Tạo đơn hàng mới\nGiá bán = Giá chốt - Tiền cọc đã capture
Order --> Adapter: OrderCreated (orderId)
deactivate Order

Adapter --> Settle: Success
deactivate Adapter

Settle -> Redis: clearSessionCache(sessionId)
activate Redis
Redis --> Settle: Success
deactivate Redis

Settle --> Scheduler: Settle Completed
deactivate Settle

@enduml
